[en.FOCUS_C12_AIR_TO_GROUND_SPECIAL_FROSTING]
Air-to-Ground Special Frosting

[en.FOCUS_C12_AIR_TO_GROUND_SPECIAL_FROSTING_desc]
Through studying Pinkie Pie’s production plans, we can bake up a highly destructive ammunition using materials commonly found before the Last Roundup. When these cost-no-object explosives are loaded onto our airships, they will be capable of delivering devastating blows to enemy forces below.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_AIR_TO_GROUND_SPECIAL_FROSTING]
空对地特质糖霜

[zh.FOCUS_C12_AIR_TO_GROUND_SPECIAL_FROSTING_desc]
通过研究萍琪派的制作方案，我们可以使用终末之战前随处可见的材料来烘焙制造出一种具有破坏力的弹药，当这些不计成本的炸药被填充到我们的飞艇上后，将可以对下方的敌军造成猛烈的打击。

